n| With Claude Desktop MCP server | `pip "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"install \"lightroom-py[mcp]\"` |\n| With ExifTool fast-path for XMP | `pip install \"lightroom-py[exifto"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ol]\"` |\n| Everything (mcp + exiftool + dev) | `pip install \"lightroom-py[all]\"` |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### macOS TCC-protected venvs\nLaunchAgents on macOS can't read files under `~/Documents`, `~/Desktop"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"`, `~/Downloads`, `~/Pictures`, `~/Movies`, `~/Music` without Full Disk Access. **Install your venv "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"outside those dirs**:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"`lightroom setup` and `bridge install-service` detect protected paths and refuse with workaround ins"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"tructions before silently failing."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Windows\nManual bridge start (no LaunchAgent equivalent yet):"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## What you can do"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Surface | Verbs |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| **Catalog** | `catalog open / info / stats` — counts of photos / folders / keywords / collections "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"|\n| **Photos** | `photos list / count / find-by-path` — filter by rating, camera, lens, keyword, dat"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"e, color label, file format, **ISO, aperture, focal length, GPS**; SQLite read fast-path (50k+ catal"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ogs return instantly) |\n| **Selection + nav** | `select`, `select-all/none/inverse/extend`, `next`, "},{"id":"p19s5","text":"`previous` |\n| **Flags + ratings** | `flag-pick/reject/clear`, `rate-up/rate-down`, `color-cycle` |\n"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"| **Metadata** | `add-keywords` (hierarchical `\"People\\|Family\\|Mom\"`), `rate`, `color`, `set-iptc` "},{"id":"p19s7","text":"(caption/title/headline/copyright/creator/city/state/country) |\n| **XMP** | `metadata write-xmp / re"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"ad-xmp` + ExifTool fast-path |\n| **Develop — globals** | `apply-preset`, `apply-settings`, `paste-se"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"ttings --subset`, `get-settings`, `copy`, `reset`, live `set` |\n| **Develop — typed** | `crop`, `hsl"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"`, `color-grade`, `transform`, `lens-correction`, `calibration`, `detail`, `effects` |\n| **Develop —"},{"id":"p19s11","text":" tone curve** | `curve get/set/preset/linear/s-curve` — RGB + per-channel |\n| **Develop — snapshots*"},{"id":"p19s12","text":"* | `snapshot create/list` — safety checkpoints before agent edits |\n| **Develop — process version**"},{"id":"p19s13","text":" | `process-version get/set` |\n| **Develop — targeted resets** | `reset-crop / -masking / -spot / -r"},{"id":"p19s14","text":"edeye / -transforms` |\n| **Masks — read + clear** | `mask list / clear` (unified `MaskGroupBasedCorr"},{"id":"p19s15","text":"ections` schema, LR 15.3+) |\n| **Masks — create** ⭐ | `mask create-radial` (**verified end-to-end**)"},{"id":"p19s16","text":" + `create-linear` (best-effort) with 20+ Local* adjustments per mask |\n| **AI mask compute** ⭐ | `a"},{"id":"p19s17","text":"pply-preset --folder \"Adaptive: Subject\"` + `library export` → LR's \"AI Updates Required\" dialog → o"},{"id":"p19s18","text":"ne click → mask renders (verified 20.91% pixel-diff) |\n| **Collections** | `list / create / add / re"},{"id":"p19s19","text":"move / delete / get-photos` — regular + smart |\n| **Library** | `list-folders`, `export` (JPEG/TIFF/"},{"id":"p19s20","text":"PSD/DNG with **watermark, output sharpening, resize, DPI, filename templates, minimize-metadata**), "},{"id":"p19s21","text":"`make-virtual-copy`, `stack` |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### What's NOT implementable (Adobe SDK gaps, documented)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Surface | Why |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| **AI Denoise compute** | LR exposes no public trigger for `Enhance → Denoise…`. Stage settings, us"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"er clicks Enhance. |\n| **Brush mask creation** | `Mask/Paint` schema (`Dabs:` stroke array) not yet "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"probed. Use radial as workaround for v0.6. |\n| **Spot removal create** | Not exposed in LR 15.3. |\n|"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" **Photo deletion** | `cat:trashPhotos` doesn't exist in 15.3. |\n| **Virtual copy delete** | Only cr"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"eation works. |\n| **Lightroom Cloud (LR CC)** | Partner-API gated; we target LR Classic. |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Command cheatsheet"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Full reference: docs/cli-reference.md. The 20 most common patterns:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Three ways to use"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### 1. CLI"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### 2. Python API"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Full async sub-client reference: docs/python-api.md."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### 3. Claude / agent skill"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"The package ships a canonical SKILL.md installable via `lightroom skill install` (also done automati"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"cally by `lightroom setup`). It activates on `/lightroom` or intent like *\"cull these photos\"*, *\"ap"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"ply my warm preset to the selection\"*, *\"export the 5-star photos as JPEGs\"*."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"For Claude Desktop's MCP integration: `pip install \"lightroom-py[mcp]\"` + point Claude Desktop's con"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"fig at the bundled `lightroom-mcp` binary. See docs/mcp.md."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### 4. DeepSeek Harness (dsh)"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"This repository is also a DeepSeek Harness plugin bundle (`package.json` + `cordis.patch.yml` at the"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" root — pure configuration, no build step):"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"All 15 MCP tools become native dsh tools; the agent skill is shipped as `dsh/skills/lightroom/SKILL."},{"id":"p38s2","text":"md`. Details and the skill-discovery note: dsh/README.md. Any other MCP client (Codex CLI, Cursor, G"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"emini CLI, OpenCode) works the same way — point it at the `lightroom-mcp` binary."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Why this exists"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"LR Classic is the most locked-down RAW editor for automation: no AppleScript, no COM, no UXP. The Lu"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"a plugin SDK is the only door, and `LrSocket` / `LrHttp` are outbound-only — a plugin physically can"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"not host a server. `lightroom-py` is the missing Python-side counterpart: a tiny `.lrplugin` polls a"},{"id":"p40s4","text":" local Python HTTP server, and Python (or Claude via the bundled agent skill / MCP server) drives Li"},{"id":"p40s5","text":"ghtroom by enqueueing commands."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
